<title>UK: Credit Suisse set calls on Swiss industry sector.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse set calls on Swiss industry sector.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creit Suisse (Zurich) has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on Swiss blue chip companies in the Industry sector, lead manager Credit Suisse said.  There are three million warrants on ABB AG bearer shares, three million warrants on Alusuisse shares and four million warrants on Nestle AG shares.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE SHARE IS CONTROLLED BY 20 WARRANTS.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.OCT.96-15.OCT.97   PAYDATE	30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>+ + + + + + + + +</p>
<p> WARRANTS  SPOT	 STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> ABB AG    1554 CHF   1600 CHF  4.65 CHF  9.0 PCT     16.7 X</p>
<p> ALUSUISSE 937 CHF    975 CHF   3.35 CHF  11.0 PCT    14.0 X</p>
<p> NESTLE AG 1394 CHF   1450 CHF  3.50 CHF  9.0 PCT     19.9 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
